1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,239
Pairs that are regularly confused.

2
00:00:02,239 --> 00:00:08,216
Since marks a point of time, for a length: since twenty nineteen, for three years.

3
00:00:08,216 --> 00:00:10,598
During takes a noun, for a period.

4
00:00:10,598 --> 00:00:18,268
By means not later than: finish it by Friday; until means up to that moment: wait until Friday.

5
00:00:18,268 --> 00:00:22,421
In time means early enough; on time means punctually.

6
00:00:22,421 --> 00:00:25,130
Between two, among more than two.

7
00:00:25,130 --> 00:00:29,257
And beside means next to, besides means in addition to.

